abstract: |
  This repository contains the data, methodology, and results of a landslide susceptibility mapping study
  conducted in Udayapur District, Eastern Nepal, using the GIS-based Frequency Ratio (FR) method.
  The work was originally performed in ArcGIS and is now organized as an open, reproducible research project.
  Code is released under the MIT license; data and documentation are released under CC BY 4.0.
  https://github.com/PramodSubedi/Landslide-Susceptibility-Mapping
